<title>USA: ModaCAD licenses software to Fleetwood.</title>
<headline>ModaCAD licenses software to Fleetwood.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>ModaCAD Inc on Friday said Fleetwood Enterprises Inc, a maker of recreational vehicles, has licensed ModaCAD's computer automated design (CAD) software for industrial design, product development and merchandising applications.</p>
<p>Financial terms of this agreement were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
